<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highlands appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highlands appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highlands Gold Ltd said it has appointed Clive Hilderbrand as its new chairman following the retirement of former chairman Norm Fussell in July. Highlands said Hilderbrand has also been appointed a director of the Papua New Guniean gold and copper miner.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
